ble-wrap-foot><p>Variables are presented as number of participants and percentage in brackets for categorial data. For continuous variables, median with interquartile range or mean with standard deviation are displayed if the variables are normally distributed or not normally distributed</p></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></p><p id="Par49">After the 2nd vaccination (see Table <xref rid="Tab2" ref-type="table">2</xref>), there was a statistically significant decrease in WCC (6.51<inline-formula id="IEq1"><alternatives><tex-math id="M5">\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
